a06", "download_count": 2, "created_at": "2026-11-09T07:20:20Z", "updated_at": "2026-11-09T07:20:27Z", "browser_download_url": "https://github.com/Kototoro-app/Kototoro/releases/download/v2.4.1/Kototoro-2.4.1-x86-release.apk"}, {"url": "https://api.github.com/repos/Kototoro-app/Kototoro/releases/assets/726595693", "id": 726595693, "node_id": "RA_kwDOQKjWSM4rTvht", "name": "Kototoro-2.4.1-x86_64-release.apk", "label": "", "uploader": {"login": "github-actions[bot]", "id": 41898282, "node_id": "MDM6Qm90NDE4OTgyODI=", "avatar_url": "https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/in/15368?v=4", "gravatar_id": "", "url": "https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D", "html_url": "https://github.com/apps/github-actions", "followers_url": "https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/followers", "following_url": "https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/following{/other_user}", "gists_url": "https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/gists{/gist_id}", "starred_url": "https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/starred{/owner}{/repo}", "subscriptions_url": "https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/subscriptions", "organizations_url": "https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/orgs", "repos_url": "https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/repos", "events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/events{/privacy}", "received_events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/received_events", "type": "Bot", "user_view_type": "public", "site_admin": false}, "content_type": "application/vnd.android.package-archive", "state": "uploaded", "size": 148610199, "digest": "sha256:fb26de44770327e856e64e1be925c284de0b15d5300d48b98e1d026775b7b94e", "download_count": 3, "created_at": "2026-11-09T07:20:20Z", "updated_at": "2026-11-09T07:20:27Z", "browser_download_url": "https://github.com/Kototoro-app/Kototoro/releases/download/v2.4.1/Kototoro-2.4.1-x86_64-release.apk"}], "tarball_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/Kototoro-app/Kototoro/tarball/v2.4.1", "zipball_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/Kototoro-app/Kototoro/zipball/v2.4.1", "body": "## Kototoro 2.4.1\n\n### Android 与桌面 / Android & desktop\n\n- **Cloudstream 插件按官方应用的方式加载**：插件加载时拿到的是与 Cloudstream 一致的 Activity，并补上插件常用的应用类，缺少部分宿主接口不再直接拒绝安装，而是交由插件实际加载结果决定。在 23 个社区仓库的 444 个插件中，Android 上 437 个可完整链接，Windows 上 439 个可以加载（含 CNC Verse 全部 7 个提供者）。\n  **Cloudstream plugins load the way the official app hosts them:** plugins receive an activity like Cloudstream's own, and the app classes they commonly reach for are provided. Missing host API no longer blocks installation; the plugin's own load decides. Across 444 plugins from 23 community repositories, 437 link fully on Android and 439 load on Windows (including all seven CNC Verse providers).\n- **窄屏播放控件可横向滚动**：播放器底部操作按钮放不下时可以左右滑动，不再被挤出屏幕。\n  **Scrollable compact playback controls:** when the player's action buttons do not fit, they scroll sideways instead of being pushed off screen.\n\n### Android\n\n- **Cloudstream 插件设置与稳定性**：插件的设置页可从来源设置打开；插件请求重启应用时只重新加载该插件，经由插件代码的崩溃不再导致整个应用退出。\n  **Cloudstream plugin settings and stability:** a plugin's settings screen opens from the source settings page. A plugin asking to restart the app reloads only that plugin, and crashes inside plugin code no longer end the app.\n- **在剧集面板中添加书签（#657）**：播放器剧集面板的列表行新增书签按钮，列表与网格都可长按切换，网格中已加书签的剧集显示角标。\n  **Bookmark episodes from the episode panel (#657):** list rows in the player's episode panel have a bookmark toggle, both list and grid toggle on long-press, and bookmarked episodes show a badge in the grid.\n- **播放器方向（#658）**：「播放设置」新增「播放器方向」：自动（原有默认）、上次使用、横屏、竖屏、反向横屏、反向竖屏；选择「上次使用」时按上次旋转的状态打开。\n  **Player orientation (#658):** *Playback settings* gains *Player orientation*: Automatic (the previous default), Last used, Landscape, Portrait, Reverse landscape and Reverse portrait. *Last used* reopens the player the way the rotate button left it.\n- **画面比例快捷按钮**：播放控件新增画面比例按钮，点击即可在各比例之间切换。\n  **Aspect ratio shortcut:** the playback controls gain an aspect ratio button that cycles through the available ratios.\n- **Android 12 及以下的透明系统栏**：修复部分 Android 10–12 系统即使使用手势导航，导航栏仍不透明的问题。\n  **Transparent system bars on Android 12 and below:** fixes the navigation bar staying opaque on some Android 10–12 ROMs, even with gesture navigation.\n- **详情页底栏玻璃效果（#656）**：手机布局下详情页底部操作栏的玻璃效果会折射下方滚动的简介、标签和相关作品，而不只是背景图。\n  **Details dock glass (#656):** on phone layouts the details dock's glass now refracts the description, tags and related works scrolling beneath it, not only the background image.\n- **底部导航间距**：浮动导航按钮周围与选中项内留出更多空间。\n  **Bottom navigation spacing:** more room around the floating navigation buttons and inside the selected item.\n\n### 桌面 / Desktop\n\n- **Linux 上 Anime4K 不再黑屏**：修复 Linux 上启用 Anime4K 时画面变黑的问题。\n  **No black Anime4K frames on Linux:** fixes the picture turning black when Anime4K is enabled on Linux.\n\n### iOS / iPadOS\n\n- **长时间任务在后台继续**：扩展安装/更新、备份导出与恢复、WebDAV 与 Google Drive 同步在离开应用后继续运行，并在应用内和系统进度中显示进度；更新检查会显示已发现的新章节、失败和跳过数。\n  **Long work continues in the background:** extension installs and updates, backup export and restore, and WebDAV and Google Drive sync keep running after leaving the app, with progress shown in the app and in the system. Update checks report new chapters, failures and skipped titles.\n- **后台下载剧集**：剧集下载改用系统后台传输，应用被挂起或被系统结束后仍会继续下载。\n  **Background episode downloads:** episodes download through the system's background transfers, so they continue while the app is suspended or after the system ends it.\n- **后台同步**：WebDAV 自动备份与新增的 Google Drive 定时同步可在后台执行，授权失效时会发送通知。\n  **Background sync:** WebDAV auto backups and a new Google Drive sync interval run in the background, with a notification when authorization fails.\n- **通过 Google Drive 同步来源状态**：来源的置顶、开关与排序会与 Android 双向同步，以最新的修改为准，合并后无需重启即可生效。\n  **Source states sync through Google Drive:** source pins, switches and order sync both ways with Android, the newest edit wins, and merged changes apply without a restart.\n\n### 下载与安装 / Downloads & installation\n\n| 平台 / Platform | 安装包 / Package |\n| --- | --- |\n| Android | 通用包 `Kototoro-2.4.1-release.apk`，也可按设备选择 ABI 包。 / Use the universal APK or select the matching per-ABI APK. |\n| Windows x64 | 构建时遇到 GitHub 下载服务故障，安装包稍后补上。 / The build hit a GitHub download outage; the package will be added later. |\n| Linux x64 | 构建时遇到 GitHub 下载服务故障，安装包稍后补上。 / The build hit a GitHub download outage; the package will be added later. |\n| macOS | 构建时遇到 GitHub 下载服务故障，安装包稍后补上。 / The build hit a GitHub download outage; the package will be added later. |\n| iOS / iPadOS | `.ipa` 未签名，需自行签名安装，也可添加 AltStore / SideStore 源。 / The IPA is unsigned and requires signing before installation, or add the AltStore / SideStore source. |\n\n**完整变更 / Full changelog:** [v2.4.0...v2.4.1](https://github.com/Kototoro-app/Kototoro/compare/v2.4.0...v2.4.1)\n\n<details>\n<summary>完整提交列表 / Full commit list</summary>\n\n- chore: bump version to v2.4.1 (f7b68e1b3)\n- docs: define the release notes format for agents (52e78ff5c)\n- feat(player): scroll compact playback controls (f5ef18210)\n- feat(player): add aspect ratio shortcut (23e690e8c)\n- fix: add space around floating navigation buttons (cff166604)\n- fix: add breathing room to selected navigation item (21e0b11ac)\n- feat(ios): download episodes in the system's background sessions (38215f14a)\n- feat(ios): keep long work running in the background with live progress (d4855fd95)\n- fix(ios): sync source pins, switches and order through Google Drive (25fd365b3)\n- feat(video): bookmark episodes from the player's episode panel (4144e3b1e)\n- feat(video): let the player open in a chosen orientation (9a968cc22)\n- fix(ui): keep system bars transparent on Android 12 and below (0bcb9163d)\n- fix(details): let the compact dock glass sample the scrolling content (9dd25d9ca)\n- feat(desktop): give Cloudstream plugins the machine's memory info (a40953366)\n- feat(desktop): bring Cloudstream plugin loading on Windows to parity (7b0988b68)\n- fix(cloudstream): load plugins the way the official app hosts them (77b049fa3)\n- fix(desktop): avoid black Anime4K frames on Linux (d6d30cb30)\n\n</details>\n", "reactions": {"url": "https://api.github.com/repos/Kototoro-app/Kototoro/releases/438833909/reactions", "total_count": 1, "+1": 0, "-1": 0, "laugh": 0, "hooray": 0, "confused": 0, "heart": 1, "rocket": 0, "eyes": 0}}}